														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1469752">
									

<p>I was iffy about the indestructibility. I liked the image of a ceramic bowl falling from a 30m ceiling and not breaking, but I'm not married to it being invincible.</p>
<p>I wasn't going for scary. I was aiming for odd. Obviously a bowl of cereal that threatens you can't be taken too seriously, until of course those threats come true.</p>
<p>-edit-<br />
I also didn't want to make another object that just babbles weird stuff and everyone is rapt to see what it'll say next. I wanted it to be focused as being as menacing as a bowl of cereal can be.</p>

