			<div class="content" id="post-content-1469754">
									

<p>Yeah, I agree the messages should be a bit stranger, but still along the same general lines. Here's some suggestions:</p>
<p>THEIR LAUGHTER WILL RATTLE YOUR BLEACHED BONES<br />
THE RECKONING DRAWS NEAR<br />
ALL THE FAITHFUL SHALL STRAY<br />
ALONE FOREVER<br />
WE WAIT FOR YOU TO JOIN US<br />
SPIDERS<br />
STUB YOUR TOE MOST PAINFULLY<br />
THERE IS NOWHERE TO RUN BUT DOWN<br />
NOTHING REMAINS BUT SPITE</p>
<p>Oh, you know what? There should be an addendum that correlates this thing's activity with unusual transmissions from <a href="/scp-1548">SCP-1548</a>. Sure, gratuitous cross-references. But it's totally in character for 1548.</p>

